TEXT -160 864 Left 2 ;.op
TEXT -160 896 Left 2 ;.noise V(out) Vin dec 20 1k 100Meg
TEXT -160 928 Left 2 ;NCM-LDO (neutralized current-mode LDO), 180 nm: 1.8 V -> 1.40 V, 10 mA, overhead 289 uA, 1.0 nF.
TEXT -160 960 Left 2 ;Pass = 100 x Mref mirror (gds cancelled); Cn ~ Cgd(Mpass) supplies the gate current at node r;
TEXT -160 992 Left 2 ;the tracking amplifier holds r = Vout through cascode Mc (body tied to r).
TEXT -160 1024 Left 2 ;Rg (Vin->g) keeps the gate-node pole up at light load; its current is not mirrored.
TEXT -160 1056 Left 2 ;Cff across Rtop: beta -> 1 above ~100 kHz, so the loop crosses at ~21 MHz and the divider noise is bypassed.
